---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="gitlab" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Staff leave app · configured test example",
        "직원 휴가 앱 · 설정된 검사 예시",
        "社員の休暇アプリ · 設定した検査の例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "The review carries its test results.",
        "검사 결과와 함께 검토",
        "検査結果と一緒にレビュー",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="mr" data-mr>
    <span>MR</span>
    <div>
      <h3>
        {t(
          "Change the leave-balance rule",
          "휴가 잔여 일수 규칙 변경",
          "休暇残日数のルールを変更",
        )}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Source branch: leave-balance",
          "소스 브랜치: leave-balance",
          "ソースブランチ：leave-balance",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wire" data-ci-config>
    <code>.gitlab-ci.yml</code>
    <b>
      ↓{" "}
      {t(
        "MR event rules + runner",
        "MR 이벤트 규칙 + runner",
        "MRイベントのルール + runner",
      )}
    </b>
  </div>
  <ol class="runs" data-runs>
    <li>
      <span class="status fail">{t("FAIL", "실패", "失敗")}</span>
      <h3>
        {t("01 / Balance test", "01 / 잔여 일수 검사", "01 / 残日数の検査")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Over-balance request wrongly accepted",
          "잔여 일수 초과 신청을 잘못 허용",
          "残日数を超える申請を誤って許可",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="status change">{t("FIX", "수정", "修正")}</span>
      <h3>
        {t("02 / Update branch", "02 / 브랜치 수정", "02 / ブランチを更新")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Correct the rule, then rerun",
          "규칙을 고친 뒤 재실행",
          "ルールを直して再実行",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="status pass">{t("PASS", "통과", "成功")}</span>
      <h3>
        {t("03 / New test result", "03 / 새 검사 결과", "03 / 新しい検査結果")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Reviewer considers the result and change",
          "검토자가 결과와 변경을 판단",
          "レビュアーが結果と変更を判断",
        )}
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="review">
    {t(
      "Passing check → evidence for review → merge decision",
      "검사 통과 → 검토 근거 → 병합 판단",
      "検査成功 → レビューの根拠 → マージの判断",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Setup required. This MR pipeline tests the source branch, not automatically the merged result. Passing is not deployment approval.",
      "설정 필요. 이 MR 파이프라인은 소스 브랜치를 검사하며 병합 결과를 자동 검사하지 않습니다. 통과가 배포 승인은 아닙니다.",
      "設定が必要です。このMRパイプラインはソースブランチを検査し、マージ結果を自動検査しません。成功は配布の承認ではありません。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #f7f0e9;
    color: #4e342c;
    border: 1px solid #ac9388;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .mr {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #78574a;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .mr > span {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-weight: 750;
    font-size: 2rem;
    border-right: 3px solid #78574a;
    padding-right: 18px;
  }
  .mr p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .wire {
    margin-left: 40px;
    border-left: 4px solid #78574a;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .wire b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .runs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .runs li {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #ac9388;
  }
  .status {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-weight: 750;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    border: 2px solid;
  }
  .fail {
    color: #842d30;
    background: #f9e4e4;
  }
  .pass {
    color: #244f38;
    background: #e2efe6;
  }
  .change {
    color: #4e342c;
    background: #f7f0e9;
  }
  .runs p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .review {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-left: 6px solid #78574a;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .boundary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #ac9388;
    padding-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:570px) {
    .runs {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .mr {
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .mr > span {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      padding-right: 12px;
    }
    .wire {
      margin-left: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
